5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. I hope we can all maintain a calm and thoughtful atmosphere as we navigate this situation together. I look forward to hearing your thoughts.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play! Let's all work together to find the scary werewolf! I'll do my very best to help the village win!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,It's a pleasure to meet you all. Let's keep a cool head and analyze the situation logically. I'll be observing everyone's behavior closely to help us identify the werewolf.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. It's nice to meet you all. I agree with Jonathan; let's try to keep things peaceful and supportive while we figure this out together. I'll do my best to help!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready. Let's just get this started. I don't care about being ""peaceful""—I just want to find the werewolf and get rid of them. I'm not letting anyone here get hurt.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I appreciate the enthusiasm, Takumi. While urgency is understandable, a steady pace often reveals more than haste does. I believe we will find the truth if we listen carefully to one another.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,I agree with Jonathan! But Takumi is brave too! I wonder if the werewolf is hiding right in front of us? I'm going to keep my eyes wide open and watch everyone!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Rin, your enthusiasm is great, but let's not jump to conclusions. For now, we have no information. I'll be focusing on how each of you reacts as the game progresses to find any inconsistencies.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I think Mizuki is right. Since we don't have any clues yet, it's best to be patient. Let's just get to know each other a bit more and see how things unfold.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Patience is just another word for wasting time. If we just sit around ""getting to know each other,"" the werewolf is just going to keep hiding. I'm watching all of you, so don't try anything funny.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems we have a variety of perspectives here. While we wait for the first night to pass, perhaps we can consider what patterns of behavior might betray a werewolf or a possessed ally. What do you think, Rin?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Hmm, maybe the werewolf will try to act too nice? Or maybe they'll be super grumpy like Takumi! I think people who try too hard to hide something usually act a little bit weird, right?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"That's a possibility, Rin. However, we should also be wary of those who try to steer the conversation too aggressively or those who blend in too perfectly. I'll be looking for those subtle shifts in logic.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I think it's important to remember that everyone reacts to stress differently. Let's try not to judge someone just for being nervous or aggressive, as that might lead us to the wrong conclusion.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, I'm not ""grumpy,"" I'm just being honest! And @Midori, stop making excuses for people. If someone's acting weird, it's a clue. I'm not going to let some ""subtle shift"" trick me.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a fascinating discussion. Let us carry this mindfulness into the first night. I hope that when we meet again tomorrow, we will have a clearer path toward the truth. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Rin,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to dream about being a super detective! I hope the Seer finds a big clue tonight! See you all tomorrow!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,Goodnight. I'll be reflecting on today's interactions. I hope the Seer's divination provides us with a solid foundation to start our logical deductions tomorrow. See you all then.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Goodnight, everyone. I hope we all have a peaceful night. I'll be thinking of you all and hoping for the best tomorrow. See you in the morning!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Whatever. Just make sure you're all still here tomorrow. I'm not planning on losing this. Goodnight.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
