31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. It is a heavy burden to share, but for the sake of our village, I must reveal that I am the Seer. My divination shows that Takumi is the werewolf.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Rin,,"WHAT?! No way! @Jonathan is the Seer and @Takumi is the werewolf?! That's so scary but so cool! I knew something was up with how grumpy he was! Is it really true, Jonathan?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, that is a very bold claim to make so early. While it simplifies things, we must consider if you are actually the Seer or a Werewolf attempting to frame Takumi immediately. @Takumi, what is your response?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Midori,,"@Jonathan, that's quite a surprise. @Takumi, this is a very serious accusation. Please tell us your side of the story so we can understand what's happening. I want to make sure we don't make a mistake.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, you're lying! I'm not the werewolf! You're just trying to frame me so you can get away with it. I'm a villager! Don't listen to him, everyone! He's the one you should be worried about!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, I understand your caution; it is a logical approach. However, the truth is often simple. @Takumi, your denial is expected, but it does not change the result of my divination. I speak with sincerity.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, why are you shouting so much? You're acting just like I thought a werewolf would! @Jonathan seems so calm and sure, so I think he's telling the truth! We should believe the Seer!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, please calm down. Emotional reactions aren't evidence. @Jonathan, if you are the Seer, you've handed us the win on a silver platter. It's almost too convenient. @Takumi, your reaction is typical for a framed villager, but it's also a perfect werewolf cover.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, you're right that we should be careful. It's a very tense situation. @Jonathan, if you are the Seer, your courage is admirable, but @Takumi is so adamant. Is there any other reason you chose to reveal yourself so quickly?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Midori, why are you even asking him that?! He's just trying to sound smart to trick you! @Jonathan is the werewolf, and he's trying to get rid of me before I can figure him out! I'm not lying!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Midori, I revealed myself because the truth is clear, and delaying the execution of a werewolf only risks more innocent lives. @Takumi, your anger is understandable, but it does not mask the reality of your nature.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Jonathan is being so brave! If he's the Seer, we can win right now! @Takumi, you're just getting more and more grumpy! That's a total werewolf move! I think we should trust Jonathan and vote for Takumi!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, your eagerness is making you overlook the risks. If Jonathan is the Werewolf and we execute Takumi, we've just lost a human and given the enemy a huge advantage. We need to weigh the probability of a fake Seer versus a real one.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, you make a very valid point. If we make a mistake now, it could be devastating for the village. @Jonathan, I want to believe you, but the risk is high. Does anyone else have a feeling about this?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Mizuki is the only one actually thinking! @Jonathan is just playing a part to look ""brave"" while he tries to kill me! If you guys vote for me, you're just doing exactly what the werewolf wants! Don't be idiots!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I understand the hesitation, but please consider the cost of doubt. If I am the Seer, every moment we hesitate is a moment the werewolf remains among us. I trust in your wisdom to see the truth.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm with Jonathan! He's been so nice and calm, while Takumi is just yelling at everyone! If we don't vote for the werewolf now, someone might get eaten tonight! Let's trust the Seer and save the village!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, your composure is consistent, but so is @Takumi's frustration. However, if we execute a villager now, we lose a vital vote. I'll vote for Takumi, but only because the Seer's claim is direct.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I'm still very torn, but since Mizuki and Rin are both leaning toward trusting Jonathan, I think it's best for the harmony of the group to follow the Seer's lead. I'll vote for Takumi.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Rin"",""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"You're all making a huge mistake! @Jonathan is playing you for fools! If you kill me, you're just helping the werewolf win! I'm not giving up—I'll prove you're all wrong! I'm voting for Jonathan!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
